# loft_ring.tlspr's smooth loft closed into a ring by [closed] on its
# screen, then held square at its first profile by 1 and at its last by
# 0.5, by their rows' [change]; the same as path_loft_ring_ends.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/loft_ring_ends).
file $testdata/ui/loft_ring.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
twmove 137 400
twdown L 137 400
twup L 137 400
twmove 407 330
twdown L 407 330
twup L 407 330
twmove 236 267
twdown L 236 267
twup L 236 267
edit 1
twmove 236 287
twdown L 236 287
twup L 236 287
edit 0.5
